BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nuit Blanche at the 519
DTSTART:20261003T190000
DTEND:20261003T190000
UID:540dc186df1539849fc2b5f7522cb590@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for Saturday\, October 3 - we’re celebrating c
 reativity from dusk til dawn! As part of Nuit Blanche\, The 519 will be ex
 hibiting “Prismatic Futurity”. This special installation will be revea
 led on the street outside The 519 at 7 p.m. “Prismatic Futurity” invit
 es audiences to imagine queer futurity with The 519 at the centre of Toron
 to’s Church-Wellesley Village. Anchored to the facade between the herita
 ge building and the modern addition\, the installation unfolds as a field 
 of iridescent triangular pyramids that bridge the past\, present\, and fut
 ure. This installation was designed by artist Simon Liao (@queer.arrival)\
 , with support from 50th Anniversary Sponsor and Art Installation Partner 
 TD. From 7 p.m. to midnight\, join us on the street in front of The 519 fo
 r snacks and hot drinks. Nuit Blanche programming will be happening across
  the city from 7 p.m. until 7 a.m. We also invite you to an exciting night
  of dance in our ballroom - tickets will be on sale soon! [Image Descripti
 on: A poster with rainbow spectrum highlights in a reflective material. It
  reads: Nuit Blanche at The 519. Nuit Blanche in Toronto: Saturday\, Octob
 er 3\, 7 pm to Sunday\, October 4\, 7 am. Prismatic Futurity by Simon Liao
 : Launches October 3\, at 7 pm. Free outdoor public art installation on Th
 e 519 facade. Snack Bar at The 519: 7 pm - Midnight. 50th Anniversary Spon
 sor\, and Art Installation Partner. TD Logo.] ‍
LOCATION:The 519 Community Centre\, 519 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/nuit-blanche-at-the-519
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
