BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sapphic Wellness Summit: The Sexual Health Series
DTSTART:20261004T111500
DTEND:20261004T111500
UID:9acf1577f458e8e8151b41b15729f975@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The Sapphic Wellness Summit is the only full-day sexual health
  event in Canada that centers sapphics. It has been designed to foster edu
 cation\, empowerment and connection in an affirming and inclusive space 
 – made by sapphics\, and for sapphics. [Sapphic: LGBTQ+ women\, non-bina
 ry and two-spirited folks]. This is the Sexual Health Series\, an immersiv
 e day of education\, movement\, and community all about sensuality\, pleas
 ure and sex. This will be an unapologetically sex-positive space to explor
 e and learn\, whether you’re new to sapphic sex\, want to grow with your
  lovers\, or excited to explore self-pleasure + eroticism...there’s some
 thing for everyone truly! The lineup is stacked with 4 amazing workshops t
 hat guide us through pleasure mapping\, sexual presence and then two eroti
 c dance workshops with Nine (@n9neinthehouse) and Gushy (@gushy.irl). Ever
 yone goes home with a gift bag worth over $50 with full-sized products and
  coupons galore. Early bird ends September 11! ‍
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse\, 967 College Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/the-sapphic-wellness-summit-the-sexual-hea
 lth-series
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
