BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Self Defense TO Workshop
DTSTART:20261004T190000
DTEND:20261004T190000
UID:0595f16a6ed97fa9cf683cdae77d500b@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:We&#x27\;re hosting another self-defence class\, tailored spec
 ifically for the queer community! No registration is required! Just show u
 p! We teach you everything you need to know in an emergency. From laws to 
 first aid to\, of course\, striking\, we teach it all! We&#x27\;re hosting
  another self-defence class\, tailored specifically for the queer communit
 y! No registration is required! Just show up! A place for anyone to learn 
 precious skills that ultimately make you more confident and your loved one
 s safer. Hosted in the oldest queer theatre in the world\, we don&#x27\;t 
 just teach you how to punch. We teach you everything you need to know in a
 n emergency. From laws to first aid to\, of course\, striking\, we teach i
 t all. Instruction is led by Aidan McKendrick (He/Him)\, a security profes
 sional and Katy SB (She/They)\, a black belt martial artist. By the end\, 
 you’ll have important knowledge and physical skills to protect yourself 
 and others at the most affordable price around! The venue is fully accessi
 ble except for the washrooms\, which require staff to run the elevator. Cl
 ass is a majority sit-down lecture style\, with the last third being physi
 cal practice. Instructors will make every effort to accommodate accessibil
 ity needs. Please contact us if you have specific needs or have questions.
  We are planning a masked and accessibility-focused class in the near futu
 re. Link to the slides for ease of note-taking and reference here https://
 docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MaC-LbXN5XZZ0EeF_2kBH3GvU-NtsQCpajv8LZmpP8
 E/edit?usp=sharing ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-self-defense-to-workshop-2
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friends of Roxy - A Queer Comedy Fundraiser!
DTSTART:20261004T203000
DTEND:20261004T203000
UID:46b2a4e2a7351023aca2baee4125dd06@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Toronto&#x27\;s top queer and allied comedians take the stage 
 to raise funds for people living with HIV / AIDs! Toronto! Come out for a 
 hilarious night of queer comedy raising money for a great cause! This show
  features Toronto&#x27\;s top 2SLGBTQIA+ comics taking the stage to raise 
 funds for Friends for Life bike rally\, supporting people living with HIV/
 AIDs. Doors at 8 pm\, show from 8:30 - 10 pm. Right in the heart of the Vi
 llage at Pegasus on Church! All welcome\, including allies! Admission is f
 ree with donations gratefully accepted for the Friends for Life bike rally
  to support people living with HIV/AIDS. Donate here on Eventbrite or with
  cash in person at the event. Will it be weird if I come solo? Nope! Feel 
 free to pop in\, watch some comedy\, and dip after if you aren&#x27\;t fee
