BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:(b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND
DTSTART:20261009T220000
DTEND:20261009T220000
UID:2e37060064ec3812bf426063399b40ac@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:(b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND returns to Geary Warehouse: a free night
  celebrating queer &amp\; trans POC nightlife in Toronto. Angelito Collect
 ive returns to Toronto for the second installment of (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND
  at Geary Warehouse. Hailing from New York City\, Angelito Collective is a
  Black trans-led multimedia creative and talent group curating forward-thi
 nking cultural experiences that spotlight emerging and established talent 
 across music\, fashion\, and visual arts. Since the debut of the collectiv
 e’s nightlife series\, (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND\, at Dweller this past Febr
 uary\, the series has continued to evolve as a celebratory sonic incubatio
 n—championing some of the most exciting queer and trans POC voices in Ne
 w York City nightlife\, including MS. CARRIE STACKS\, DANIRO\, TYGAPAW\, S
 YDFALLS\, DJ COWRIIE(KEIYAA). For its second Toronto installment\, (b)ODY 
 (p)USSY (m)IND once again brings its energy across the border\, accelerati
 ng the heartbeats of Toronto with Angelito Toronto resident DJs DEMIIGODDE
 S\, SUPREMEWRECK\, and FANNDEMM\, alongside special guest DJs EMRYSLAZULI 
 and AMANIEYES. In partnership with Geary Warehouse\, Angelito is committed
  to making this a free and accessible event. The rising cost of nightlife 
 in Toronto has created increasing barriers to spaces that center the visib
 ility\, amplification\, and celebration of queer and trans POC artists wit
 hin the city’s music scene. At its core\, (b)ODY (p)USSY (m)IND is about
  more than the dance floor. It is about creating the conditions for possib
 ility—making room for new connections\, new collaborations\, and new vis
 ions for what nightlife and community can be. This night is not only a cel
 ebration of the emerging pulse of Toronto’s underground scene\, but an i
 nvitation to participate in something larger: ambitious visions of culture
 \, community\, connection\, and possibility. ‍
LOCATION:Geary Avenue Warehouse Project\, 209 Geary Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/b-ody-p-ussy-m-ind
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
