BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lez Beach
DTSTART:20261011T180000
DTEND:20261011T180000
UID:21b81b9515fdb302c72137633da832de@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:We’re U-Hauling back to the beach for the final time this ye
 ar on SUNDAY\, October 11th 🔥🪵✨ Ferries stop heading to Hanlan’s
  on October 14th\, so we’re closing off the season. Join us to watch the
  sunset\, enjoy a bonfire made by our strong lesbian hands\, and connect w
 ith the community. This is an even chiller vibe than our usual gatherings\
 , so feel free to bring your poetry\, guitars and anything else you’d li
 ke to share. 🌭We will have free marshmallows\, smore supplies and hotdo
 gs (including vegan and halal options!) 🌬️ It gets cold on the island
  after dark\, so we highly suggest bringing a sweater and a blanket! ⛴
 ️ We’re handing out 50 free ferry tickets at the Jack Layton Ferry Ter
 minal. Catch the 5:15PM! The last ferry back to the city is at 10:30. Pack
  up by 10 to make sure you don’t get stranded! 🔥 Please practice fire
  safety. If you want to build your own\, make sure you know what you’re 
 doing and you bring your own wood! Removing wood from the island can serio
 usly harm the ecosystem. 👯 The fun doesn’t have to end because the fi
 re’s put out! Link in bio for the OFFICIAL Lez Bonfire afterparty ticket
 s. Code BIPOC for 15% off. Thank you to @c1foundation\, @citypoolwarrior a
 nd everyone who has donated in the past. Community effort keeps this gathe
 ring alive! Lez Beach is first and foremost a grassroots gathering to comb
 at rising levels of harassment and exclusion towards lesbians in queer spa
 ces. Hanlan’s Point Beach is a public\, clothing optional space and we c
 annot control who can and who cannot enter the space during Lez Beach. If 
 you have concerns about the crowd\, please come sit with us at the entranc
 e to the event! We keep each other safe. If you’ve never attended before
 \, take a look at our FAQ posts! This is a gathering to encourage safety a
 nd reclaim space for sapphics in the queer community. There is zero tolera
 nce for racism\, transphobia\, fatphobia or misogyny. If you do not connec
 t to the sapphic experience\, we ask you to reconsider the space you’re 
 entering. Poster art + graphics by @azaydrea ‍
LOCATION:Hanlan&#x27\;s Point Beach\, Toronto Islands
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/lez-beach-2027
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Primal Forest
DTSTART:20261011T210000
DTEND:20261011T210000
UID:1afc640261ac1f27042973f23172a387@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:On October 10th lets celebrate our autumn season with getting 
 into a primal headspace. Within the kink community primal play is a form o
 f play where one can act purely by instinct\, without self-restraint\, whe
 re we can act in a way free from societal expectations. While it often inc
 orporates getting in touch with the animal within\, its true purpose is to
  enter a headspace where instinct is the driving force. Primal play is ana
 logous to ecstatic dance - where you completely lose yourself in the music
  and dance freely\, without any fucks given to those around you. Come be p
 rimal with us. ----- With music by: maemae Veronica Electronica [live hybr
 id set] Risky Medicine Psyberix SouthPawBrown Loving Hand ----- RavePartyM
 achine events are for: bisexuals\, pansexuals\, gays\, straights\, goths\,
  punks\, pups\, purrverts\, queers\, BIPOC folks\, BDSM practitioners\, le
 sbians\, furries\, swingers\, cosplayers\, latex lovers\, leather lovers\,
  kinksters\, kandi ravers\, fashionistas\, haute couture lovers\, j-fashio
 nistas\, alt-fashion fans\, hedonists\, vanillas\, dommes\, subs\, and sta
 rfish sex lovers. Be sure to read the code of conduct linked in the promot
 ional section below. Primal is not a play party - so there is no dungeon o
 n the premises. We can provide discounts to any marginalized group or to a
 nyone that needs it. Just dm or email and we&#x27\;ll provide a discount l
 ink. Avoid disappointment by getting an advance ticket. It is likely to se
 ll out. The few remaining door tickets will be $30 cash at the door. Absol
 utely no photography or video allowed. ‍
LOCATION:BSMT 254\, 254 Lansdowne Avenue
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/primal-forest
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
