BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:forever night 4....feat. Mutualism\, stiff dance\, bip b2b GRRLCRR
 SH\, zola\, dj miss\, Critter
DTSTART:20261016T220000
DTEND:20261016T220000
UID:9456e53a0b2f9d284a37f9819fafff36@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup upstairs: + Mutualism ++ B I P b2b GRRLCRRSH +++ Zola 
 (TRM) ++++ Critter +++++ Aji (2) downstairs: + Stiffdance ++ dj miss +++ @
 loverose Can you believe it’s been one-year since we started Forever Nig
 ht? We’re so grateful to everyone who’s supported us thus far. This ne
 xt event is dedicated to all the freaks you’ve been around since day one
 . We love you. We head back to Jama on October 16th for another pre-Hallow
 een moment that will feature the hottest DJs on both floors. I know we alw
 ays say this lineup is insane\, so we’re gonna say it again... this line
 up is insane! We’re blessed to have Mutualism making her Toronto return 
 at Forever Night. A resident DJ at Buffalo’s long-standing\, beloved que
 er party Buddy Buddy\, she is known for her infectious energy\, dynamic se
 ts\, and love of collecting + playing on vinyl. With a penchant for uplift
 ing melodies\, powerful percussion\, and divalicious moments\, Mutualism t
 akes dancers on a wild ride. Sometimes it’s pretty\; sometimes it’s pr
 etty bonkers. And it’s always a party. She’ll be joined on the main fl
 oor by Bodyclock resident Zola\, a DJ and creative conjurer known for her 
 high-voltage blends of techno\, house\, electro\, bass\, dance\, and every
 thing in between. Main floor also features slippery basslines from Critter
 \, diasporic club sounds from Aji\, and an epic B2B from Grrlcrush and BIP
 . But wait…….we aren’t done yet! Here&#x27\;s what&#x27\;s happening
  in the basement! Coming all the way from Richmond\, Virginia\, is Stiffda
 nce\, a DJ who weaves together rigid tempos and chaotic rave energy to bub
 bly synths and unexpected textures. She’s contributing a lot to Richmond
 ’s DIY music culture and playing shows at New York hotspots like Gabriel
 a\, Night Club 101\, and Bossa Nova Civic Club. DJ miss will be joining St
 iffdance downstairs\, injecting the dancefloor with cutie\, sexy grooves\,
  and Loverose will start things off with a blend of dark electro\, goth in
 dustrial\, and ebm. Blair\, Marina\, and Rose Hips will be on hosting duti
 es all night. Gear/Sexy/Fetish dress code in effect. This month\, Blair is
  opening up the runway\, and there might be some prizes to win\, so if the
 re was ever a time to bust out your freakiest looks\, this is your moment!
  More details on that later! Dress code is not strict\, but encouraged. As
  always\, be sexy! Be fun! Whatever that means to you. Coat/clothes check 
 will be available downstairs. Harm reduction supplies provided by Fentawar
 e. Door tickets will be available\, subject to capacity. See you soon! ‍
LOCATION:The Jama\, 961 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/forever-night-4-feat-mutualism-stiff-dance
 -bip-b2b-grrlcrrsh-zola-dj-miss-critter
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
