DTEND:20261023T220000
UID:4e25fb325ea4d1bc594f9169aff8617f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:WISHING WELL PART 22: FANS Fans that blow you\, fans that know
  you Fans that move air\, fans that are always there A fan cracks loud\, a
  fan stands out in the crowd This party is about FANS: hand fans\, ceiling
  fans\, big fans\, small fans\, gay fans\, fandoms\, fan clubs\, superfans
 \, die-hard fans\, fanatics Are you a fan of WISHING WELL? Let the FANtasy
  begin! BRING YOUR OWN FAN - there will be an ONLY FANS altar where you ca
 n take a fan/leave a fan\, so you can keep your fan game fresh and fluid a
 ll night! DRESS CODE: FANS\, super fans\, paparazzi\, cool\, celebrity\, a
 n outfit made of fans\, air\, blowing\, movement\, flabellum\, groupie\, a
 ficionado. BRAWK WARD will be hosting Wishing HELL: a special space in the
  party that is deeply unpleasant and horrific. It’s a bad party portal\,
  it’s HELL! This is where the BAD fans go. Don’t worry\, it’s going 
 to be a FANtastic night &lt\;3 BIG STARLIGHT PERFORMANCE at midnight – t
 his intimate and vulnerable solo explores starlight’s complex relationsh
 ip to her fame and to her fans. A raw\, never-before-seen look into her pr
 ocess\, her deepest secrets\, and her bare soul. This time we are going to
  the DANCE CAVE at Lee’s Palace! Help us invigorate this herstoric queer
  space with our faerie magic. Get ready to DANCE! Do you know the iconic c
 horeo?? You’ve seen it at past Wishing Wells\, if you’re a fan. We’l
 l be teaching it all night\, so you’ll pick it up no problem. For the ne
 w fans: WISHING WELL is a queer witchy danceparty ritual with pop-up perfo
